The sociedade mecânica de futebol (SMF) avatar grid used as the README banner
(docs/assets/sociedade-generator-banner.png) documents historical outputs of
the generator.

The SMF identity lockup is this repository's GitHub social preview. It is set
in the repository's settings and is not part of the source tree.

